        overview: 'Coulomb\'s law, electric fields, electric potential, current, resistance, Ohm\'s law, electrical power, Kirchhoff\'s rules, magnetic field and flux, Faraday\'s induction, semiconductors, P-N junction diodes, transistors, and logic gates.',
