        overview: 'Distinguish sensation and perception; explain sensory thresholds (Absolute Threshold, Difference Threshold/JND, Weber\'s Law) and Sensory Adaptation; analyze Attention, Gestalt Laws of Form Perception, Binocular and Monocular Depth Cues, Perceptual Constancies, and Visual Illusions.',
