        moduleName: 'Emerging',
        overview: 'Examine the relationship between technology and ethics; internalize the 7 General Ethical Principles, 9 Professional Responsibilities, and 7 Professional Leadership Principles; master Digital Privacy (Information, Communication, and Individual Privacy) and its principles; and evaluate accountability, trust, and emerging tech threats.',
