        moduleName: 'Entrepreuner',
        overview: 'Understand the Timmons Model of Entrepreneurship; analyze new venture expansion strategies and the Ansoff Growth Matrix; internalize Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR), Triple Bottom Line, Stakeholder Theory, and Business Ethics.',
