                problem: 'An Ethiopian bottled-water company currently selling 1-liter water bottles only in Addis Ababa considers four growth options: (A) Running a "Buy 5 Get 1 Free" promotion in Addis Ababa; (B) Exporting its existing 1-liter water bottles to Djibouti; (C) Launching flavored vitamin-infused sparkling water for its existing Addis Ababa customers; (D) Opening a cement factory in Dire Dawa. Classify options (A), (B), (C), and (D) using the Ansoff Growth Matrix.',
